$ golem-launcher cache clean
-- stdout --
removed 2 cached entries

$ golem-launcher cache clean -color=sometimes
-- stderr --
error: -color must be auto, always or never, not "sometimes"

Usage: golem-launcher cache clean

Deletes the cached builds, releases, baselines and Go toolchains that the
current launcher.json does not need. Go's own module and build caches stay.

Example:
  golem-launcher cache clean

Flags on every command:
  -config file   the launcher's configuration (default launcher.json)
  -cache dir     where toolchains, releases and builds are kept
                 (default: the user cache directory + /golem)
  -color when    colour and progress bars: auto, always or never (default
                 auto: on a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set; FORCE_COLOR
                 forces colour)
-- exit: 2 --

